+ * /reason-editor route), and the host has its own typography, colors and
+ * theme tokens. A bare `body { background; color; font-family }` repaints
+ * the WHOLE host page in the engine's palette, `:focus { outline: none }`
+ * strips focus rings off every control the host owns, and a bare `code` rule
+ * restyles every inline code span in the host app. It is not a
+ * specificity contest either: the engine's sheet is unlayered, and unlayered
+ * CSS outranks the host's `@layer base` rules no matter how specific they are.
